,"CIHM0ogKEICAgICKp7-iXw",1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這裡有大份量的料理，超划算的價格，三不五時還會舉辦各種活動，可以滿足只想吃飽、吃想喝酒、還是喜歡熱鬧的捧油\n#可倫堡1664生啤酒 喝起來有豐富的花香及柑橘香，入口微苦又回甘，層次感極為豐富，而且喝完不會渾身的啤酒臭味，我們在場的所有人都超愛喝\n#丼飯 及 #炒烏龍，價位介於$150上下，好吃又美味，並不會因為便宜就隨便\n超推炸物裡的#甜不辣，吃起來很有魚漿滋味，口感不會像魚酥，炸功遠比鹽酥雞攤好上N倍\n#蛤蜊湯 直接來一鍋湯，裡頭好多大顆飽滿的蛤蜊，醒酒來一碗很不錯\n#蚵仔蛋 只有蛋和海量蚵仔，絕對打趴各大熱炒店\n來居酒屋一定要點的 #烤物 和 #串燒，份量還比一般居酒屋多更多\n不過阿連強推 #青甘魚下巴 油脂豐富，肉質細緻，口感清甜，整個下巴幾乎都是肉，外面日料or居酒屋都要400以上，這裡竟然只要$199很誇張啊",null,[0,161]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4334073311914186757/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkxjRGN0YzBOM0VBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4334073311914186757/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkxjRGN0YzBOM0VBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4334073311914186757/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkxjRGN0YzBOM0VBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4334073311914186757/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkxjRGN0YzBOM0VBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4334073311914186757/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkxjRGN0YzBOM0VBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4334073311914186757/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkxjRGN0YzBOM0VBRRAA"]],[null,null,8411,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNLcDctc0N3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x196450e3f96e9911!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICKp7-sCw%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNLcDctc0N3EAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNLcDctc0N3Ei4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ0twNy1zaXdFEhNDZ3dJdk51QmhBWVE4TnloM0FFGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ0twNy1zU3cSE0Nnd0l2TnVCaEFZUThOeWgzQUUiEgkAAAAAAAAAABERmW7541BkGSoLMFZWNXIwai1KaGs\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjToL38yN